==Battleground==
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gude-Doge Machine]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

